# JanDhan Insights — Environment Variables Example
#
# JanDhan Insights is a self-contained Vite + React + TypeScript civic transparency portal
# with bundled verified Pune Municipal Corporation (PMC) datasets.
# No database credentials, backend secrets, or AI API keys are required to build or deploy.

# Optional: Public canonical site URL if hosted behind a custom domain
# VITE_PUBLIC_SITE_URL="https://example.org"
